      "id": 1,
      "text": "In 1795, after the Treaty of Greenville, Samuel and Rebecca DeMent Pierson built the first log home near Deer Park.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
